laminate: 45° Carbon Highlights (tip to tail carbon layer, 45° angled fibres fine tuning torsional flex)
core: Super Fly II 700G with Dualzone EGD and Squeezebox (stronger and lighter woods targeted in specific areas, more pop and strength, reduced weight)
core zones: Dualzone EGD (wood grain aligned along heel and toe edge in two unbroken zones perpendicular to rest of core for consistent edge hold and strength)
core sections: Squeezebox (thicker more powerful sections combined with thinner more flexible sections profiled throughout the core for enhanced energy transfer)
edges: Frostbite Edges (edges extend out slightly underneath bindings for enhanced edge hold on hardpack and ice)
base: Sintered WFO (extra absorbent, high density sintered material infused with specially formulated wax, ultra durable)
factory conditioning: Infinite Ride (boards overbuilt in factory then broken down by machinery so board rides same from day one to day 100)
tip/tail design: Pro-Tip (tip and tail taper out at points, reducing swing weight and promoting mobility)
resin: Super Sap Epoxy (bio-based resin reducing carbon footprint by 50% over conventional petroleum-based epoxies)
shipping restriction: Only available for shipping within Australia
